<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεωκοπ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut down a debt, defraud one's creditors,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.829c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.3.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.345
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλῶν θανάτων ὀφειλήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					38
				</span></i>
			/<i><span class="en">
				9.8
			</span></i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.764a
				</span></i>
			; <i>withhold fraudulently,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος ἥμισυ</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				968d
			</span></i>; <i>minimize,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι τῆς διδασκαλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					6.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>cut down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				137.13
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be cheated</i> or <i>defrauded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.829c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				81.2
			</span></i>; <i>to be disappointed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>. (It is uncertain whether <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεοκ-</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεωκ-</span> should
			be read: 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεοκ-.</span>
			)</div>
